{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23873","headline":"劝酒十四首 何处难忘酒七首 四 · 白居易","name":"劝酒十四首 何处难忘酒七首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处难忘酒，霜庭老病翁。\n闇声啼蟋蟀，乾叶落梧桐。\n鬓爲愁先白，颜因醉暂红。\n此时无一醆，何计奈秋风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}